# Enterprise Business Intelligence (EBI) — Platform Constitution

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Frozen · Canonical analytics service  
Sprint foundation: **CO-BIZ-003**

## Constitutional principles

1. EBI is a **read-only intelligence layer** — no workflow changes, no new ownership models.
2. **Do not introduce new sources of truth.** Compose Deal Registry / Radar · ETE · EDL (where applicable) · Governance · Observability · Registries.
3. **Never duplicate business metric formulas.** Call existing SSOTs (`buildChanakyaRadarDashboard`, `computeOperationalVector`, `buildEteOperationalReport`, EI derive-story, etc.).
4. Mission Control / Manager / RM / Branch dashboards **consume EBI providers** — they do not recalculate KPIs.
5. CHANAKYA executive insights must explain **observation + reason** from EBI compose outputs.

